config MI_HARDWARE_ID
	tristate "Xiaomi hardware identification"
	depends on QCOM_SOCINFO
	help
	  Expose Xiaomi project, region and board revision information supplied
	  through the hwid module parameters. Required by Xiaomi board drivers.
	  The hwid_value, project, project_adc and build_adc parameters must
	  be supplied by the device's boot/module-loading configuration.
	  If built as a module, the module will be called hwid.
